      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPRING VICTORIA (2) finished fifth last time at this track but could not have been more impressive before that in her excellent 29.32 win at this track over 515m. Smart win two back and looks a key chance here. GENERAL FRANKY (5) goes very well this course and distance starting 14 times for six wins and five minors. Scored by half a length last time (29.50) in a Grade 5 over 515m at this track. Can hit the frame with the right run. VICTORY BARRY (1) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (34.72) from Box 2 at The Meadows. Hard to beat again. PAW XEROX (8) collected a minor prize last start in a close contest - must be considered.",
